(7459704, 1182540, 38032, '<td valign="top">in cold blood ... Really nice studio shot with cool lights meet the challenge. To be picky, I would say the light could be a bit more even and the composition could be more dramatic - I also feel the subject could use just a bit more context. That being said, overall a well-done, professional looking shot. 7</td>', 'in cold blood ... Really nice studio shot with cool lights meet the challenge. To be picky, I would say the light could be a bit more even and the composition could be more dramatic - I also feel the subject could use just a bit more context. That being said, overall a well-done, professional looking shot. 7', '2016-06-10 07:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
